  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "One split that matters",
      "items": [
        "The widget shells out; the script owns all ADB",
        "So the shim works from a terminal, and is the one half with a test"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Everything reads through panel",
      "items": [
        "Components take a panel; Panel is a Theme and fronts Config, Service, Bindings",
        "Actions go out as one bar.run() each: fire-and-forget, never chained"
      ]
    }
  ]
